# /services (no trailing slash) is the canonical Services hub URL; the root
# .htaccess rewrites it to the CMS. Because this directory really exists,
# Apache's DirectorySlash would otherwise 301 /services → /services/?page=services
# (leaking the rewrite's query string and splitting the page's ranking signals).
# Directory listings are already disabled site-wide (Options -Indexes).
DirectorySlash Off
